# Machine mode takes a nested machine software interrupt after re-enabling MIE.
# Host setup preloads:
# - machine timer mapped at 0x3000_0000 with mtimecmp = 1
# - mstatus.MIE enabled
# - mie enables machine timer and software interrupts
# - mtvec = 0x20 in vectored mode
# The outer machine-timer handler saves mepc/mstatus, disarms the timer, records
# x10 = 10, re-enables MIE, raises MSIP through MMIO, then resumes after the
# nested handler to record x11 = 11, restore state, and mret. The inner machine
# software handler clears MSIP, records x12 = 12, and mret returns to the outer
# handler. Mainline finally resumes and writes x1 = 1.
# Expect x1 = 1, x10 = 10, x11 = 11, x12 = 12, x21 = 21, privilege = Machine.
